的街道反射着五彩斑斓的光影，营造出迷离的科幻氛围。一位亚洲女性身穿银灰色与电光蓝相间的金属质感紧身连衣裙，搭配透明PVC材质的外套，站在天台边缘。服饰的冷色调与周围霓虹灯光相互辉映。人造光源在湿润的地面上投下斑斓倒影，增强了画面的纵深感和未来感。\n整个场景以高饱和度的色彩和科技元素，既展现出都市夜晚的繁华与冷漠，又因前卫的服饰设计呈现出一种叛逆而先锋的高级时尚感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 102, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [751.2930297851562, 797.6717529296875], "pos": [1561.295654296875, 880.602783203125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 142, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 100, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["泛黄，发绿，模糊，低分辨率，低质量图像，扭曲的肢体，诡异的外观，丑陋，AI感，噪点，网格感，JPEG压缩条纹，异常的肢体，水印，乱码，意义不明的字符"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 82, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [399.1872253417969, 124.05753326416016], "pos": [116.50713348388672, 1207.125732421875], "id": 71, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "